// SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
//
// The workspace exists for Dependabot, which treats the modules listed here as one: it runs `go get` in each,
// `go work sync`, and `go mod tidy` in each, so that a bump of the root module and the modules that follow it form
// one tidy pull request. Nothing else builds in workspace mode: scripts/task.sh, scripts/agentkit.sh, and CI set
// GOWORK=off, so that every module is checked as it stands alone.
//
// Three modules stay out, since `go work sync` would raise their requirements to the server's. pkg/mykit and
// pkg/mybot are published, and their go.mod reaches their users; tools/go.mod pins the tools apart from the product.
// scripts/go-work-check.sh keeps this list and the go line true.
go 1.27.3

use (
	.
	./pkg/mybot/integration
	./pkg/mykit/integration
	./tools/agentkit
)
